# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Vivi Ornitier's {0} mana ability is limited to once each turn and adds X mana where X is its power.
# Forcing: Vivi has two +1/+1 counters (power 2). Divination costs {2}{U}; Vivi plus one Island pays it.
# AI behavior: The opponent has no permanents or hand, so it makes no decisions.
# Card roles:
#   Vivi Ornitier — the limited mana source under test; it does not tap for mana.
#   Island — pays the blue part of Divination; the second Island is an unlimited control source.
#   Divination — observable consumer of Vivi's mana.
# Protocol path: mana ability activation, combo mana choice, spell payment, offer recomputation, next-turn reset.

